                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d6666713-efa3-3712-ae31-5174ee7c284b",
                        "entry_id": "54a4f2b3-c307-38ed-bf29-94bd2776a4f7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Autre épouse dans un mariage polygame."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ddaea3f2-6dfb-4182-b94d-0b938dd3b229",
                                "sense_id": "d6666713-efa3-3712-ae31-5174ee7c284b",
                                "text": "De toutes façons, avertie ou non, une femme n’a aucun droit à s’opposer à l’arrivée d’une co-épouse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce357bf7-39f4-480d-bd60-5457f6fff54a",
                                "sense_id": "d6666713-efa3-3712-ae31-5174ee7c284b",
                                "text": "Une jeune femme pratiquant l’agriculture nous a révélé souhaiter l’arrivée d’une co-épouse dans la famille, car les travaux des champs sont très pénibles pour une seule femme."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "94291511-f5f8-4074-8d70-139b01c062c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "54a4f2b3-c307-38ed-bf29-94bd2776a4f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "d6666713-efa3-3712-ae31-5174ee7c284b",
                        "target_lang_word": "co-wife",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "co-wife",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50cec514-3dd0-3f1c-80af-86b476f070ce",
                                        "entry_id": "539994c0-05e8-3da6-b567-e704092e28f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a polygamous marriage, another wife of a woman’s husband."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ce8adb8-e079-4ab7-91cb-f86ca03d9b93",
                                                "sense_id": "50cec514-3dd0-3f1c-80af-86b476f070ce",
                                                "text": "If a co-wife had sought the lives of those three of thine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "034acfcf-6fbc-42d3-b8c1-cb4f8a319321",
                                                "sense_id": "50cec514-3dd0-3f1c-80af-86b476f070ce",
                                                "text": "In fact, [Ayesha] was more jealous of Khadija, the dead wife, than she was of any of her living co-wives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5befd7f8-ae7b-4bf8-bfb5-531d6d90a68d",
                                                "sense_id": "50cec514-3dd0-3f1c-80af-86b476f070ce",
                                                "text": "If the senior wife decides to make life unbearable for her co-wife and their husband, she is likely to succeed in forcing the newcomer to leave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3c32351-38ed-4823-937f-4969624b7442",
                                                "sense_id": "50cec514-3dd0-3f1c-80af-86b476f070ce",
                                                "text": "In other words, polygamous societies differ markedly with regards to allowing kin, especially sisters, to become co-wives. Sororal polygamy is practised in some societies because it is believed to foster greater cohesiveness among co-wives sharing values and norms, whereas it is specifically forbidden in other polygamous societies."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2b5c8191-6ad7-445f-a48d-5fc1d7068668",
                        "source_entry_id": "54a4f2b3-c307-38ed-bf29-94bd2776a4f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "d6666713-efa3-3712-ae31-5174ee7c284b",
